    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "💰 Expense Categorizer & Budget Alert | n8n AI Automation\n\nJust completed another AI automation workflow using n8n! 🚀\n\nThis workflow helps users track their monthly expenses without manually categorizing every transaction.\n\n🔹 Workflow Features\n\n✅ Collect expenses through a form\n✅ AI automatically categorizes each expense\n✅ Classifies spending as Need or Want\n✅ Stores data in Google Sheets\n✅ Calculates monthly spending by category\n✅ Compares expenses against predefined monthly budgets\n✅ Sends a professional email alert when a budget is exceeded\n\n💡 Budget Categories\nFood & Dining\nTransport\nUtilities & Bills\nShopping\nEntertainment\nHealth\nOther\n\nInstead of reviewing expenses at the end of the month, users receive an instant notification as soon as a category exceeds its budget—helping them make smarter financial decisions before overspending becomes a bigger problem.\n\nBuilding real-world AI automations that combine AI, Google Sheets, JavaScript, business logic, and email notifications is a great way to solve everyday financial challenges.\n\nI'm continuously expanding my portfolio with practical n8n AI Automation projects.\n\n#n8n #AIAutomation #WorkflowAutomation #GoogleSheets #JavaScript #ArtificialIntelligence #FinanceAutomation #NoCode #LowCode #Productivity #Automation #LinkedIn",
        "height": 608,
